        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Athena is a 1986 side-scrolling platform game developed and published by SNK, in which players control Princess Athena as she traverses a series of mythological worlds in an effort to return to her own realm. The gameplay centers on navigating platform-based stages, defeating enemies, and collecting weapons, armor, and power-ups that enhance the protagonist’s abilities and survivability.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Athena es un juego de plataformas de desplazamiento lateral de 1986, desarrollado y publicado por SNK, en el que los jugadores controlan a la princesa Athena mientras recorre una serie de mundos mitológicos en un intento por regresar a su propio reino. La jugabilidad se centra en navegar por etapas de plataformas, derrotar enemigos y recolectar armas, armaduras y power-ups que mejoran las habilidades y la resistencia del protagonista.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
